      "decision_index": 78,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Chose Glacial Dragonhunt (Harmonize) over Winternight Stories (Harmonize) from graveyard. Glacial Dragonhunt costs all 6 mana for draw 1 + conditional 3 damage (which doesn't kill the 2/4 Formidable Speaker anyway). Winternight Stories costs only 5 mana for draw 3 (discard 2 or 1 creature), providing much better card advantage and leaving 1 mana open for Spell Snare in hand.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Glacial Dragonhunt via Harmonize for {4}{U}{R}, using all available mana",
      "better_line": "Cast Winternight Stories via Harmonize for {4}{U}, drawing 3 cards with better net card advantage, while keeping 1 mana open for Spell Snare",
