      "decision_index": 87,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Glacial Dragonhunt only deals 3 damage to a target creature when you discard a NONLAND card. By discarding Spirebluff Canal (a land), the damage ability never triggers, completely wasting the removal mode of the spell. The opponent has creatures on board (Formidable Speaker, Superior Spider-Man) that could have been targeted.",
