    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "At 4 life with many lands already in play, Spirebluff Canal will always enter tapped (more than 2 other lands). Steam Vents at least has the option of entering untapped in the future if life total allows. Playing the land with no future upside first is correct sequencing.",
      "action_taken": "Played Steam Vents (which enters tapped at 4 life), saving Spirebluff Canal",
