    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "The player's reasoning states Bitter Triumph can kill the opponent at 4 life, but Bitter Triumph only destroys creatures or planeswalkers - it cannot target players. Meanwhile, they have lethal on board: Superior Spider-Man (4/4) + Formidable Speaker (2/4) = 6 damage against an opponent at 4 life with everything tapped. Casting Bitter Triumph wastes a card and resources (discard or 3 life) unnecessarily.",
