    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Opponent is at 4 life with all permanents tapped. The only blocker (Eddymurk Crab) is tapped. Destroying the Crab with Bitter Triumph and attacking with Superior Spider-Man (4) + Formidable Speaker (2) = 6 damage is lethal. Instead, KimiK2 targeted their own Superior Spider-Man with Bitter Triumph, destroying their best attacker and wasting removal.",
